  Hypothesis DS1 : PP + 8 <= lo \/ bv_unsigned sp <= PP.
  Hypothesis DS2 : VALP + 4 <= lo \/ bv_unsigned sp <= VALP.
  Hypothesis DS3 : Z.of_nat (length bs) = 0 \/ BUF + Z.of_nat (length bs) <= lo \/ bv_unsigned sp <= BUF.

